### 🧪 DIY Practice: Biometric Face Scan Verification
### WireMock URL: http://localhost:8088

### 1. Test Passing Case: Confidence >= 85.0
### Expected: 200 OK with dynamic scanId and processedAt timestamp
POST http://localhost:8088/lab/api/ekyc/biometrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationalId": "1100500123456",
  "confidence": 92.4,
  "livenessPassed": true
}

###

### 2. Test Failing Case: Confidence < 85.0
### Expected: 422 Unprocessable Entity {"error": "LIVENESS_FAILED", "code": "ERR_LOW_CONFIDENCE"}
POST http://localhost:8088/lab/api/ekyc/biometrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationalId": "1100500123456",
  "confidence": 71.2,
  "livenessPassed": false
}

###

### 3. Test Delay & Client Timeout
### Injected fixed delay of 2500ms
POST http://localhost:8088/lab/api/ekyc/biometrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nationalId": "1100500123456",
  "confidence": 88.0,
  "livenessPassed": true
}

###

### 4. Admin API: Reset Stubs after Editing
POST http://localhost:8088/__admin/mappings/reset
